---
description: Explicit high-stakes decisions only — Council protocol, gates, forecasts, living memory. Not weekly ops or release gates.
alwaysApply: false
---

Load `ai-council` only when the user **explicitly** asks for Council / „Radę”, material
GO/NO-GO/TEST/DEFER on strategic choices, living decision revalidation, or Council health.

Do **not** use for: sprint prioritization (`product-operator`), whole-repo roadmap
(`repo-to-roadmap`), pinned RC deploy gate (`release-readiness`), or routine research.

Run `scripts/council_kernel.py` for contract, plan, gates, freshness — do not reimplement in prose.

Notion bindings: `~/.config/cometweb/ai-council-notion.json` (never commit).
